      "writtenOn": "2024-11-18T16:04:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The synchronization has to cover the onStop() calls since they cause the state change. i.e. I am not trying to prevent the evaluation here from running at the same time as the updateParked() evaluation. Instead, I am trying to prevent this evaluation and the updateParked() evaluation from happening at the same time as the onStop() calls. I think this hints at the idea that a more fine-grained lock can be useful.",
